---
import { EARLY_ACCESS_URL } from '../config';
---
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <video class="bgv parallax" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/media/hero.jpg?v=3" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/media/hero.mp4?v=3" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="shade"></div>
  <div class="grain"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="ea-badge"><i></i>Early access · Claude Code plugin</span>
    <h1 class="mask" aria-label="Done means done.">
      <span class="ln"><span>Done means</span></span>
      <span class="ln"><span><em>done.</em></span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="sub">Your coding agent says “done” too early and runs everything on its most expensive model. Horsy sends each subtask to the cheapest model that can do it, checks the work, and steps up one model only if the check fails.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="pill silk magnetic" href={EARLY_ACCESS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get early access</a>
      <a class="pill ghost" href="#race">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <div class="installbar is-off" aria-label="Install command, available at launch"><span class="p">›</span><code>/plugin install horsy</code><span class="soon">available at launch</span></div>
    <div class="personas"><span>On a Max plan: your quota lasts longer</span><span>Paying per token: grunt work stops costing Opus prices</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:210px"></div>
</header>
